00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:47.360
these oily substances are very water repellent&nbsp;
or hydrophobic which is important because your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:52.240
lips encounter lots of water from drinking and&nbsp;
from your spit the more solid ingredients in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:57.520
a lipstick are usually waxes they're sometimes&nbsp;
called structuring agents and they're what gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:02.400
a lipstick its solid structure some of the really&nbsp;
common solid wax ingredients that you'll see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:10.000
are canauba wax candelilla wax beeswax&nbsp;
