are soft at room temperature and so they'll soften&nbsp;
the overall lipstick so that it'll actually apply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:35.360
a lot of these are also emollient moisturizers so&nbsp;
they'll keep your lips soft and moisturized there&nbsp;&nbsp;

