00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:46.400
castor oil butters like shea butter fatty esters&nbsp;
like isosteryl isostearate hydrocarbon based&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:52.080
ingredients like polybutene and mineral oil and&nbsp;
silicones like phenol trimethicone oils also give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:57.360
a shiny finish and so matte lipsticks tend to have&nbsp;
a bit less of these this is why matte lipsticks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:01.920
often have this reputation of being really drying&nbsp;
