00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:06.640
the fact that they have less oils also means that&nbsp;
they tend to last longer on your lips so they form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:12.240
a harder layer that doesn't move around and slip&nbsp;
around so much an important aspect of the base is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:18.160
that to get a smooth lipstick it has to dry into&nbsp;
