00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:23.280
so this means the lipstick applies more smoothly&nbsp;
and also it's less prone to breaking because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:28.480
a small layer of the lipstick can be left behind&nbsp;
without breaking off a large chunk if you have a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:33.680
grainy textured lipstick this is usually because&nbsp;
the base isn't a great blend another issue that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:38.560
you might see if you have a bad base mixture is&nbsp;
