some of the ingredients in the base aren't playing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:48.240
well together and so some of the oil gets squeezed&nbsp;
out sometimes this happens in hot weather because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:53.760
the lipstick melts a bit and then re-solidifies&nbsp;
and that process squeezes more oil out then we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:58.080
have the pigment which is what gives a lipstick&nbsp;
its color one of the important things about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:03.040
lipstick is that it is on your mouth which means&nbsp;
that it's one of the few cosmetic products that&nbsp;&nbsp;

