in lip products at all or they're only allowed&nbsp;
at certain concentrations the color pigment is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:24.000
dispersed in the base this means that it doesn't&nbsp;
dissolve in the base but it's ground up into tiny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.720
microscopic pieces that are spread out evenly in&nbsp;
