00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.000
lipsticks are generally easier to preserve than&nbsp;
other cosmetic products because they don't contain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.640
water they're very oil-based and so that makes&nbsp;
